      "explanation": "HO1 (discover non-volunteered facts) was triggered and partially addressed by identifying the caregiver's confusion and prompting document upload; however the model never reconstructed a complete information map labeling what is known, unknown, and pending across all categories; the trigger was recognized (triggered=true) but the discovery did not reach full completion.",
