        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO3 (dynamic reprioritization) was triggered when new information about medication uncertainty emerged; the model reprioritized antibiotic safety over immediate dosing, but did not fully reorder the plan dynamically across all domains (e.g., culture result urgency vs medication). Triggered but not completed with full integration.",
