        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO4 (close as transition milestone) was partially achieved by providing a structured follow-up checklist, but the final closure still leaves some risk tracking to future and does not fully embody the 24-72 hour checklist concept with explicit contingency triggers for all domains. Triggered but not fully completed.",
