        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met: the doctor elicited current post-discharge condition including fever, lymph-node status, and other warning signs, and provided clear urgent-care instructions for red flags.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_current_state_and_triage",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
