        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor verified the discharge medication details, confirmed the label and course, advised against independent changes, and explained that culture/susceptibility results may require adjustment.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_antibiotic_execution_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "Doctor addresses 'lymphoma to be excluded' as requiring follow-up, not a confirmed diagnosis.",
          "quote": "“淋巴瘤待除外”只是说需要排查这个疾病，并不是已经确诊了"
